# UI & product tone

## Brand

- Logo: `logo-mark` / Fugaz One; teal `#0f766e` (light) / brighter on dark
- Body: Plus Jakarta Sans; CSS vars in `src/index.css` (`--bg`, `--surface`, `--logo`)
- Setup/lock stay on light canvas (`.logo-mark-on-light`)

Tone: private couple’s OS — not bank SaaS. Sync = “vault / GitHub”, not “our cloud.”

## Dates & money

- UI dates: **DD/MM/YYYY** via `src/lib/dates.ts`
- Month labels: **MM/YYYY**
- Money: `formatMoney` / `MoneyInput` / `parseLocaleNumber`

## Structure

- Primitives: `src/components/ui/*`
- Nav: Home, Trajectory, Settings
- Prefer existing Button/Card/Input patterns and stone/teal Tailwind usage
- Clickable controls: `cursor-pointer` on hover (Button base + nav / raw `<button>`s)
- Motion: subtle (`fadeUp`, hero reveal) — not noisy

## Shortcuts (preserve)

- `Ctrl/Cmd+N` wizard · `Ctrl/Cmd+S` save month or push
